+# AGENTS.md — Nexus checkout
+
+Ignored Nexus checkout for `ahnexus`/`nexus-common`. Astrohacker issue and
+patch policy overrides conflicting upstream agent instructions. Read
+`patches/AGENTS.md`, `patches/nexus/AGENTS.md`, and its reconstruction
+README before work.
+
+The default is a zero-patch tip pin. Any intentional source edit requires an
+`issue-{ISSUE_ID}-exp{N}` branch, archive and README evidence, plus a manifest
+update if the shipped series changes, in the same experiment result. Never
+commit checkout outputs or depend on iced `nexus-client` as the TermSurf UI
+library.
